WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Crumbling Crystalline Memory Bridge, desperate.

2
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:06.300 align:center
Lyra: Bridge... collapsing! Don't look down.

3
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:08.600 align:center
Kael: The void... it hungers. Always.

4
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:10.900 align:center
Lyra: My Promise shard... almost gone!

5
00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:17.200 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Mid-span of the Crystalline Memory Bridge, urgent.

6
00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:19.500 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Your struggle is inefficient.

7
00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:21.800 align:center
Lyra: No! Not this one... not yet!

8
00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:23.100 align:center
Kael: Expend... to survive.

9
00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:25.400 align:center
Lyra: Damn it! Take this!

10
00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:34.700 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in The precipice of the Crystalline Memory Bridge, facing a stable memory-chamber entrance, desperate.

11
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:37.000 align:center
Lyra: Too far... I can't make it!

12
00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:39.300 align:center
Kael: The Promise... can shatter.

13
00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:40.600 align:center
Lyra: No! It's mine!

14
00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:47.900 align:center
♪ at dusk, in Entrance to the 'Weaving Void' Chamber, a maze of unstable memory-constructs, tense.

15
00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:50.200 align:center
Lyra: Heavy... too many. Can't see.

16
00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:52.500 align:center
Kael: The path... it shifts.

17
00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:54.800 align:center
Lyra: Just a little further.

18
00:00:56.100 --> 00:01:02.100 align:center
♪ at dusk, in Deeper within the 'Weaving Void' Chamber, a labyrinth of shifting memory-constructs, urgent.

19
00:01:02.400 --> 00:01:04.400 align:center
Lyra: Watch out! Almost hit!

20
00:01:04.700 --> 00:01:06.700 align:center
Kael: The ground... it remembers.

21
00:01:06.1000 --> 00:01:08.1000 align:center
Lyra: I know! Don't doubt me!

22
00:01:10.300 --> 00:01:18.300 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in A narrow passage in the 'Weaving Void' Chamber, a direct confrontation point, tense.

23
00:01:18.600 --> 00:01:20.600 align:center
Silence Hunter: You cling to dust.

24
00:01:20.900 --> 00:01:22.900 align:center
Lyra: Stay back! Not this way!

25
00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:24.200 align:center
Kael: Weakness... chosen.

26
00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:25.500 align:center
Lyra: Damn it! Useless!

27
00:01:26.800 --> 00:01:33.800 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in A temporary alcove in the 'Weaving Void' Chamber, after the confrontation, dread.

28
00:01:34.100 --> 00:01:36.100 align:center
Lyra: Catching breath. Need a plan.

29
00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:38.400 align:center
Kael: They know... the patterns.

30
00:01:38.700 --> 00:01:39.700 align:center
Lyra: What patterns?

31
00:01:39.1000 --> 00:01:41.1000 align:center
Kael: Our choices... their predictions.

32
00:01:43.300 --> 00:01:50.300 align:center
♪ at dawn, in A seemingly stable passage within the 'Weaving Void' Chamber, leading to a new area, tense.

33
00:01:50.600 --> 00:01:52.600 align:center
Lyra: Look! A stable chamber.

34
00:01:52.900 --> 00:01:54.900 align:center
Kael: Lyra, don't! It feels... too familiar.

35
00:01:55.200 --> 00:01:57.200 align:center
Lyra: I'm not you, Kael. I'll survive.

36
00:01:58.500 --> 00:02:04.500 align:center
♪ in broad daylight, in The 'Sanctuary' Chamber, initially appearing safe, but thick with dread, dread.

37
00:02:04.800 --> 00:02:06.800 align:center
Lyra: No... it's too quiet.

38
00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:09.100 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Welcome, Lyra. We anticipated your arrival.

39
00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:10.400 align:center
Lyra: A trap!

40
00:02:11.700 --> 00:02:17.700 align:center
♪ in broad daylight, in Inside the trap chamber, the Loom actively targeting Lyra's core memory, desperate.

41
00:02:17.1000 --> 00:02:19.1000 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: The First Promise. Our primary target.

42
00:02:20.300 --> 00:02:22.300 align:center
Lyra: No! Get away! It's mine!

43
00:02:22.600 --> 00:02:24.600 align:center
Kael: Too many... held back.

44
00:02:24.900 --> 00:02:25.900 align:center
Lyra: It won't break!

45
00:02:27.200 --> 00:02:32.200 align:center
♪ in broad daylight, in The trap chamber, Lyra reeling from profound loss, dread.

46
00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:34.500 align:center
Lyra: My... my First Promise...

47
00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:36.800 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Your hoarding ensured its demise.

48
00:02:37.100 --> 00:02:38.100 align:center
Lyra: Why?

49
00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:42.400 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: We knew you would cling. And where you would run next.
